# The build context is this producer's own directory. Only the control template,
# the copyright and the payload declaration are COPYed out of it: the binaries
# arrive through the `bin` context and the container configuration through
# `overlay`, so nothing large is ever in the path buildx has to walk.
#
# producer.env and prepare.sh are excluded deliberately. Neither is copied into
# the image, and leaving them in the context would invalidate this producer's
# cache whenever a build input that only the host reads was edited.
*
!control/*.control
!copyright
!payload.manifest
